 Troubleshooting
ALB showing unhealthy instances → fixed health check path
ASG not scaling → corrected CPU target tracking policy
Launch Template not applying → updated version number
Instance Refresh stuck → lowered minimum healthy percentage
EC2 not registering in Target Group → fixed security group inbound rules
Troubleshooting shows real cloud engineering skill.

